{
 "_doc": "Forest set pieces, round 4 (ADR-0053): the Kell Shelter, a prepper's red board cabin on a hillside over a poured concrete bunker two levels down (level -1 the storeroom and generator room, level -2 the living quarters, armory and comms room; buried, so its escape tunnel runs north under the yard to a hatch house in the woods). Route: up the drive -> the front door kicked in -> the front room's loose boards (the Pruitts upstairs wake) -> the study: the blast-door key and Gideon's journal (taking it wakes them too) -> down the ladder under the rug -> the forced shaft door -> the storeroom (the neighbours wake) -> the generator room -> the stairhead -> down to decontamination -> the blast door (deadbolt, the key) with a tripwire shotgun on its far side (the family wakes) -> the living quarters -> the armory -> the comms room (Gideon, guardian; the loot) -> the escape tunnel -> two ladders up into the hatch house (jaws by the hatch) -> draw the bolt, out into the woods. Props: props/wild4_bunker.json.",
